<title>USA: Lafayette, La., $14 mln won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Lafayette, La., $14 mln won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $14 million of Lafayette, La., public improvement sales tax bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.2961 percent.</p>
